    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the fluid looks okay on color, but i'm still seeing those spikes on the live data. could it be a solenoid or something in the valve body itself? like, is there anything specific i should look for in the pressure traces that would point to a specific part failing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
